  "_comment": "The one shared table for Controls' two pure functions (merge, combine) -- see INVARIANTS.md's tighten-only bound. Lives in the SDK's own tree, the authority both the control plane and its dashboard read across to, mirrored by their own merge module and TS preview respectively, so a divergence between any of the three fails a test in whichever one drifted, instead of only ever being noticed by a human comparing files by eye. Edit this file, not any suite's inline cases, when adding a scenario every side must agree on.",
